msgid ""
"Congratulations!\n"
"You finished the game in %1 tries.\n"
"The best you could have done is %2 tries.\n"
"Do you want to play again?"
msgstr ""
"Noraboa!\n"
"Remataches o xogo en %1 tentativas.\n"
"O mellor que o poderías ter feito sería en %2 tentativas.\n"
"Queres xogar outra vez?"

